 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 515483,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You have a hand of 5 cards (that happen to create what’s called a royal flush in the game of poker): 10<span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span>, J<span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span>, Q<span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span>, K<span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span>, and A<span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span>. Into how many different orders can you put those cards?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The Multiplication Rule of Counting says that if there are <i>n</i> ways to accomplish one task and <i>m</i> ways to accomplish a second task, then there are <span data-math=\"n{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}m\"></span> ways to accomplish both tasks. You can tack on additional tasks by multiplying the number of ways to accomplish those tasks to your previous product.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Choosing…</b></td>\n<td>You choose a card for the first position</td>\n<td>You choose a card for the second position</td>\n<td>You choose a card for the third position</td>\n<td>You choose a card for the second position</td>\n<td>You choose a card for the last position</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Number of Choices</b></td>\n<td>You have 5 choices</td>\n<td>You have 4 cards left from which to choose</td>\n<td>You have 3 cards left from which to choose</td>\n<td>You have 2 cards left from which to choose</td>\n<td>You have 1 card left from which to choose</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The number of ways you can make your choices is <span data-math=\"5{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}4{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}3{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}2{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}1{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}120\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "120"
    }
   ],
